  "basis": "The reported Interest expense component is before the separately displayed capitalized-interest deduction and before interest income. TTM capitalized interest is 151M (125 + 82 \u2212 56), shown only in the reconciliation. The coverage denominator stays 1,117M as reported; capitalized interest is not added to or subtracted from it again.",
  "composition": "The denominator excludes the separately reported unrealized swap mark-to-market effects, debt-cost amortization, extinguishment effects and Other. The mixed total is 1,132M TTM; it is not the selected interest component. Receivables-facility and Nuveen interest may sit in the component or Other; the checked filings do not establish the allocation. Other's detailed composition is Unavailable.",
  "limitations": "Historical accrual earnings coverage, not cash interest coverage, future repayment coverage, covenant headroom or drawable capacity. The numerator is reported consolidated operating income without adjusted earnings addbacks; it retains reported operating and commodity-hedge effects. The interest component is not a fully verified allocation of all borrowing and Nuveen costs. Cash swap settlements and a fully reconciled all-in financing-cost measure remain Unavailable.",
